stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Queued

    state "Queued" as Queued
    note right of Queued
        The code execution request has been received and is waiting for an available runner.
    end note

    state "Building" as Building
    note right of Building
        The environment is being prepared (e.g., pulling a Docker image, installing dependencies).
    end note

    state "Running" as Running
    note right of Running
        The code is actively being executed.
    end note

    state "Completed" as Completed
    note right of Completed
        The execution finished successfully.
    end note

    state "Failed" as Failed
    note right of Failed
        The execution failed due to a build error or a runtime error.
    end note

    Queued --> Building: startBuild() [buildRequired]
    Queued --> Running: startExecution() [!buildRequired]
    Building --> Running: buildSuccess()
    Building --> Failed: buildFailed()
    Running --> Completed: executionSuccess()
    Running --> Failed: executionError()

    Queued --> Cancelled: cancel()
    Building --> Cancelled: cancel()
    Running --> Cancelled: cancel()

    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
